  "title": {
    "rendered": "IRNAP China"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p>INSARAG congratulates China, the 10 countries in the world on the successful completion and endorsement of its INSARAG Recognized National Accreditation Process (IRNAP).</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p>This achievement highlights China’s strong commitment to INSARAG’s global standards and continuous efforts to enhance international cooperation and preparedness in Urban Search and Rescue (USAR) operations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The INSARAG Secretariat commends the dedication and professionalism demonstrated throughout the process and looks forward to continued collaboration within our global network.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" data-id=\"16628\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/fcd80289-fd58-453e-8fdc-16efc7b241a9.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16628\" style=\"width:391px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/fcd80289-fd58-453e-8fdc-16efc7b241a9.jpg 800w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/fcd80289-fd58-453e-8fdc-16efc7b241a9-300x225.jpg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/fcd80289-fd58-453e-8fdc-16efc7b241a9-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" data-id=\"16622\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/21c0edbc-d242-4745-8c57-abcd9d50b2b0-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16622\" style=\"width:553px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/21c0edbc-d242-4745-8c57-abcd9d50b2b0-1.jpg 800w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/21c0edbc-d242-4745-8c57-abcd9d50b2b0-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/21c0edbc-d242-4745-8c57-abcd9d50b2b0-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
