    "rendered": "<p>INSARAG congratulates China, the 10 countries in the world on the successful completion and endorsement of its INSARAG Recognized National Accreditation Process (IRNAP). This achievement highlights China’s strong commitment to INSARAG’s global standards and continuous efforts to enhance international cooperation and preparedness in Urban Search and Rescue (USAR) operations. The INSARAG Secretariat commends the dedication [&hellip;]</p>\n",
